OL,3,GNEWSAGrenfell NHS support service faces
OL,4,Afunding cut
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn NHS service supporting people
OL,7,Faffected by the Grenfell Tower fire
OL,8,Ffaces a funding cut from next year,
OL,9,FKensington and Chelsea councillors have
OL,10,Fheard.
OL,12,FThe Grenfell Health and Wellbeing
OL,13,FService offers therapies and groups to
OL,14,Fsurvivors, bereaved families and the
OL,15,Fwider community.
OL,17,FNHS England is reducing its funding and
OL,18,Fno service has been confirmed beyond
OL,19,F2029, a council meeting was told.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
